;; DNS records relevant to the Kuna site, excerpted from the parent
;; kestura.com zone (NOT authoritative — the parent zone is
;; managed outside this repository).
;;
;; Authoritative management: ELB Consulting Tech parent infrastructure.
;; Replicate the change below into the parent provider's control panel to
;; bring the custom domain online.
;;
;; Expected change to bring https://kushysbeautyhaven.com online via
;; GitHub Pages (LGLenz/kuna-beauty-salon-website):

$ORIGIN kestura.com.
$TTL 3600

; --- Kuna subdomain ---
; Replaces any prior A/AAAA record for `kuna` with a single CNAME to the
; GitHub Pages user site. GitHub Pages will then issue a managed TLS
; certificate for kushysbeautyhaven.com via Let's Encrypt.
kuna IN CNAME lglenz.github.io.
